<article class="env-definition" id="09SQ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09SQ">Definition <span data-tag="09SQ">13.37.5</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{D}$ be a triangulated category with arbitrary direct sums. We say $\mathcal{D}$ is <em>compactly generated</em> if there exists a set $E_ i$, $i \in I$ of compact objects such that $\bigoplus E_ i$ generates $\mathcal{D}$. </p>
